WEBVTT

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:23.640
Hey! I'm Taiki Kudou.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.210
My friends are the Digital 
monsters, Digimon!

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:29.490
And I'm Shoutmon, 
the guy who's aiming to be

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:30.590
the Digimon King!

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.370
I'm Taiki's number one partner!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:38.540
Our Digital World has been taken 
over by the evil Bagra Army.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:40.680
To bring peace back to this world,

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.410
I've decided to dive into this

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:45.480
mysterious and dangerous 
new world with Shoutmon.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:48.990
Keep an eye on our new battle 
that's about to begin!

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:50.990
Don't miss it!

00:01:51.460 --> 00:02:00.020
<b>To a New World!</b>

00:01:51.520 --> 00:02:00.020
<b>The Fire Fury General's Dragon Land</b>

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:57.960
To a New World! 
The Fire Fury General's Dragon Land!

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:06.640
I can see the exit, Shoutmon.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:07.310
Yeah.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:11.380
The passage of time is different between 
the Digital World and the human world.

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:13.840
While we were in the 
human world for a day,

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:16.410
a few months have probably 
passed in the Digital World.

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:18.930
That weird energy cloud...

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:23.620
It's probably already turned 
into a hell ruled by Bagramon.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.370
First, we've gotta look for 
the rest of Xros Heart.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:27.590
I hope they're okay.

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:29.180
Don't worry, Taiki!

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:30.600
Leave that to me!

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.970
Did you forget about that awesome 
new power I got in your world?

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:34.500
Oh, Digivolution?

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:38.440
Even if I'm on my own 
at first, I won't lose!

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:41.110
As long as I have the 
power to Digivolve!

00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:43.170
Thanks. I'm counting on you, Shoutmon.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:58.120
Huh? I was expecting hell...

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:59.540
It's pretty.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:02.990
Is this the world remade 
by the Bagra Army?

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.400
Shoutmon!

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:08.740
Hey, isn't she from your village?

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:10.940
Yeah. That's my old friend, Lillymon.

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:15.890
Hey, Lillymon! Is everyone all right?

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:18.240
What is it? What's wrong?

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.920
What do you think you're 
doing, Lillymon?

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:21.550
We have to hide Taiki fast!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.410
Now pretend you're a flower Digimon!

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:27.180
Oh, no! We've been found!

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:54.510
A bunch of... dragon Digimon?

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.640
He's the one they were after.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:18.430
Dracomon, we will not let you leave.

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:20.340
Return to our army now.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.770
I don't want to!

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:23.640
I've had enough fighting!

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:25.610
You little failure.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:29.620
But all the flower and bird 
Digimon are my friends!

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:32.320
Why do I have to be mean to them?!

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:35.400
S-Stop!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:36.710
Little fool.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:41.290
We dragon Digimon are the Bagra 
Army's strongest soldiers.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:43.530
As the guards of the Digital World,

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:46.400
it is our job to beat up 
all the other Digimon.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:50.540
This Kingdom exists for us to polish 
our fangs by tormenting the weak.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.270
That's what Dragon Land is all about!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.550
Dragon Land?

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.470
Land? What does that mean?

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:57.340
There are no Zones anymore.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:05:01.950
The Digital World has been reborn 
under the rule of the Bagra Army.

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:08.660
It was reformatted into 
the Great Bagra Palace

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.220
and seven Kingdoms ruled by 
seven terrible Death Generals.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.370
This is the first of those,

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.360
the Kingdom of beginnings 
and despair, Dragon Land.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:19.300
Seven Kingdoms?

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:20.650
We still have no idea

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.850
where Ballistamon and the others are.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:25.400
And if you're found, 
they won't let you escape alive.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:26.140
Hide!

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:31.850
Now, atone for your crimes

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.630
by burning this flower field 
and its Digimon to a crisp!

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:35.630
No!

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:36.350
What?!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:40.180
I feel really bad after being hit!

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:42.190
We can't make other 
Digimon feel like that!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.790
Then everyone will just 
feel worse and worse!

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.320
<i>He's...</i>

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.550
He really is a coward.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.180
You don't deserve to live.

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.400
I will deal with you here and now!

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.360
Who are you?!

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:03.410
You wanna know?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.590
Then I'll tell you!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.420
The name's Shoutmon!

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:09.710
Make sure you don't forget it!

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:11.900
Shoutmon, you say?

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.000
And who are you?

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.550
Uh... I-I'm...

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:20.590
I'm...

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:22.210
Ohanamon!

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:27.230
Couldn't you have picked a 
slightly better name than that?

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:28.880
Stop fooling around!

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.220
You are also a dragon 
Digimon, aren't you?

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:32.700
Do as we say!

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:33.940
I don't think so.

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:36.510
I agree with this Dracomon guy here!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:50.090
There's a dragon who's on my side...

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.770
Why, you... Get him!

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:12.000
I just need to become 
OmegaShoutmon,

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.180
and I can waste these guys with 
one hand tied behind my back!

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:15.510
Let's do it, Taiki!

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:16.420
All right!

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:17.620
Shoutmon, Digivolve!

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:19.420
Yeah!

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:23.000
Huh?

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.210
Hot! Hot!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.810
Why can't I Digivolve?!

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:28.790
Why?

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:31.030
Fool! Digivolve?

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:33.400
You can't just make that 
happen whenever you want!

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:33.980
Now, die!

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:39.070
Enemy attack!

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:55.780
Kiriha!

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.890
It's the rebel army, Blue Flare!

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:09.750
That Kiriha hasn't even 
noticed we're here!

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.830
His fighting style hasn't changed.

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.000
That's kind of a relief.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.240
I'm tired of fighting such weaklings.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.110
Come out, Dorbickmon!

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:20.550
What? He's crazy!

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.690
Dorbickmon? Who's that?

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:25.440
The ruler of this Kingdom.

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:28.240
One of the seven Bagra Generals,

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:30.050
Dorbickmon the Fire Fury.

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:53.740
I shall take charge for today.

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:56.320
Will that be all right, Brother?

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:59.190
You need not ask, DarkKnightmon.

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:02.150
I have entrusted you with 
full authority over my army.

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:05.950
The negative energy that we 
gather from all the Lands

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:10.130
will surely give your Code Crown 
an even more brilliant shine.

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:15.830
And the power of my imperial 
army will continue to grow.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:18.920
The great palace of the 
mighty Lord Bagramon!

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:21.210
Today is the day the rulers 
of the seven Kingdoms

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:25.640
will meet here again for a debriefing.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:27.910
So I must... Change Style!

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:32.910
I must go put in an appearance 
with Lord DarkKnightmon.

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:36.590
You two are on holiday, 
so you just rest here!

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.670
He really makes me mad!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:42.360
I can't believe he was 
a spy for DarkKnightmon!

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:43.850
And what did he mean, holiday?!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.720
He just wants to be included 
in the seven Generals!

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.100
I could just explode!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:51.570
Poor little Lili. Come cry on my breast.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:54.310
What breast?! You're nothing but a face!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:01.540
I am Admiral DarkKnightmon.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:05.320
It appears all seven Generals are here.

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.390
Apollomon the Sun Wheel...

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:10.370
Splashmon the Water Tiger...

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:13.160
Olegmon the Gold Thief...

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:16.200
NeoVamdemon the Moon Light...

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:19.210
Zamielmon the Wood Spirit...

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:21.720
Gravimon the Earth God...

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.510
and Dorbickmon the Fire Fury.

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.640
How are each of your Kingdoms faring?

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:33.680
What of the rebel factions that 
have persisted in resisting us?

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:37.800
Those in my Kingdom are still 
in a state of confusion.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:42.990
It appears they've returned yet again.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.560
I shall go and play with them.

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.290
I knew I could count on you.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.770
Now the screams of the Digimon

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:52.070
can echo throughout the 
Kingdoms, eh, Admiral?

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:56.070
Thanks to the negative energy of all 
the Digimon we've been torturing!

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:59.870
All for the sake of the coming 
Day of Ultimate Destruction...

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:01.840
For D5.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:05.570
For the coming D5!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.630
Where is Dorbickmon?

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:29.870
Today is the day I'll settle the score.

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:37.610
This power...

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:41.310
He's coming! Dorbickmon is coming!

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:45.950
"The day I'll settle the score"?

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:47.930
I believe that's my line,

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.150
Blue Flare!

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:04.360
Have you forgotten that I can 
manipulate the terrain as I wish?

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:06.590
As long as we fight within this Kingdom,

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:09.010
you can never win!

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:11.180
What incredible strength...

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:13.210
DeckerGreymon can't even make a move!

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:26.060
The seven Death Generals never lose.

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.370
You are finished.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:31.260
Darkness Loader, DigiXros!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.680
Death Generals?

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:36.000
Darkness Loader?

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.540
A DigiXros!

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:46.960
The enemy can DigiXros, too!

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:56.290
Y-You...

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:00.990
Kiriha!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:05.260
We will settle this 
today, as you wished.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.400
Who was that?

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:25.150
I-I believe he called himself Ohanamon.

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:27.540
I've never heard that name.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:30.210
Must be another weak rebel Digimon.

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:31.820
I will corner him.

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:35.180
Pursue the enemy in full 
force, surround him,

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:36.580
and burn him to cinders.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:39.550
That is Dorbickmon's strategy 
for certain victory.

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:42.140
Just as I'd expect of my lord.

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:44.640
Leave the pursuit to me.

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:46.440
Xros Open!

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:55.680
I can always count on Huanglongmon.

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.520
The very image of a true dragon.

00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:02.420
Weak dragons, on the other 
hand, do not deserve to live.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.390
You really saved us, Dracomon!

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:10.830
Don't mention it.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:20.810
Wow, Xros Loaders can do that, too?

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:23.500
So many underground passages down here!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.470
Did you dig all of these?

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:29.780
Yeah. This way I can always get 
away from those scary dragons.

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:32.020
Well, that's a pretty 
pathetic motive, but...

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:33.680
Still, that's amazing!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.250
I'm glad we met you!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.400
Really?

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:39.110
It was pretty scary, 
but I'm glad I could help.

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:42.090
I've always looked up to Blue Flare.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:45.850
You're a rebel army of dragons 
who fight evil, aren't you?

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:48.800
No, we're Xros Hea—

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:52.000
How do you call that "saving us"?

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:55.680
You're just a weakling 
who acted out of line!

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:57.990
Lay off, Kiriha.

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:04.750
Sort of an awkward way to 
have our happy reunion, huh?

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:07.810
What makes you think you can 
come waltzing back here now?

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:10.870
This is not a world you 
can live in anymore.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:12.990
The enemy's skill level 
is entirely different.

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:15.400
That guy they call the Death General?

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:16.490
Yes.

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:18.690
I've been fighting with all my strength

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:20.700
to get the Code Crown back.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:24.090
But because of those Darkness 
Loaders that DarkKnightmon

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:26.340
mass-produced and gave 
to the seven Generals...

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:30.010
The seven Generals gained 
the ability to DigiXros.

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:36.290
Worse, Dorbickmon uses the land to 
its full capacity when he fights.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.380
He's a fearsome enemy.

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:39.950
Kiriha...

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:43.090
It will be a while before Greymon 
and my other Digimon recover.

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:45.080
There's nothing more I can do.

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:47.690
You came back only to die, Taiki.

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:49.310
Kiriha...

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:51.540
<i>He's always been so proud,</i>

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.530
<i>and now he's talking like he's given up...</i>

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:57.180
Then let's use our wisdom 
and heart to overcome this!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.560
Let's work together!

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:02.240
You don't even know where 
your companions are.

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:04.680
What can you do with just Shoutmon?

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:07.510
I can do plenty!

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:09.210
I have the power to Digivolve!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:10.950
The power to Digivolve?

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:11.550
Wow!

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:14.140
But this is the same form 
you've always had, isn't it?

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:17.920
No, I mean I can change 
whenever I want to!

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.460
I call it Digivolution!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:22.280
I learned it in the human world.

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:24.460
I couldn't do it earlier 
for some reason, though...

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:27.950
Digivolution? It sounds like 
nothing more than a dream...

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:31.000
Just a fantasy, huh? Waste of time.

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:34.280
What'd you say?! It's the truth!

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:35.920
Nobody believes me!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.780
What do I have to do 
to Digivolve again?!

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:39.410
Shh, I hear something!

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:48.290
L-Lava?

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.680
This is the work of Dorbickmon's minion!

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:51.640
Run!

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:02.200
I am very sorry, Lord Dorbickmon...

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:05.590
You and your reports are useless to me.

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:11.030
Shoutmon is the head of 
Xros Heart's Digimon.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:14.310
Which means that flower boy was...

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:18.320
the super class A rebel, Taiki Kudou!

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:28.160
Burn to death, rebels.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:39.160
I'm sorry! I'm the one who said 
we should escape down here!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.570
It's not your fault!

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:45.870
This way!

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:50.420
There!

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:53.280
That's the closest path to the surface!

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:55.230
Taiki, what about the DigiMemories?

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:57.300
They're all too powerful.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.490
Using them in such a small 
space would put us in dange—

00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:00.990
That's it!

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.760
<b>Tailmon</b>

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.760
<b>Cat Scratch</b>

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:04.130
DigiMemory!

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:12.900
Cat Scratch, activate!

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:17.710
It'll never break through in time!

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:18.910
We're finished.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:22.070
That's what we get for accepting 
help from a weakling like him.

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.550
You're blind, Kiriha!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.320
He's far stronger than any of us!

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:31.200
He might not have much power,

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:32.920
but he's tried his hardest all this time!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:36.080
His heart is stronger than even ours!

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.440
Shoutmon...

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:39.200
I won't lose!

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.700
It's too late!

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.340
Dracomon!

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:56.730
You guys try to escape 
while I hold it off!

00:18:57.180 --> 00:18:58.980
<i>Thanks, Shoutmon.</i>

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:01.820
<i>That's the first time anyone 
ever said I was strong.</i>

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.100
<i>I am weak.</i>

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.370
<i>I was just a coward trying to run away</i>

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:07.730
<i>from being in the dragon army 
because I couldn't forget</i>

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:09.450
<i>about the peaceful world 
I used to live in.</i>

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:12.980
<i>But I managed to grow a 
little stronger in the end.</i>

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:17.230
<i>Strong and righteous dragons 
like Shoutmon and Blue Flare</i>

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:19.150
<i>will build this Kingdom!</i>

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:20.810
<i>Goodbye!</i>

00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:22.000
You idiot!

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.640
Shoutmon! Don't!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.710
I can't abandon Dracomon!

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:34.000
Th-This feeling...

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:35.470
I can do it now, Taiki!

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:37.260
Right!

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:38.940
Shoutmon, Digivolve!

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:44.660
Shoutmon, Digivolve!

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:48.680
OmegaShoutmon!

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:53.340
What?!

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:04.060
I pity those weaklings.

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:11.720
Who are you?!

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.890
OmegaShoutmon.

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:15.760
He Digivolved...

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:17.370
No way!

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:18.430
That's Shoutmon?

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:20.380
Punish them!

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.520
Hide.

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:35.310
Surround him!

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:37.200
Show him what dragon warfare is all about!

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:45.720
OmegaShoutmon!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.830
Remember what Dracomon did!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:50.800
That's right.

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:53.630
There's no skill in just attacking 
headlong all the time.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:57.130
This is Dracomon's style!

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:59.250
Beat Slash!

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.370
Trying to escape into a hole again?

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:03.640
Fill it with flames!

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:13.130
And going for the strongest 
one is <i>my</i> style!

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.640
Heavy Metal Vulcan!

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:24.810
All right!

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:26.700
You're amazing, Shoutmon!

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:28.500
He Digivolved...

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:31.000
to... OmegaShoutmon?

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:41.640
Not bad. This should be entertaining.

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:45.700
No! It's the one with the 
power to manipulate the land!

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:47.050
Dorbickmon!

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:50.350
So you're the one even Lord 
Bagramon was cautious of...

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:53.580
the boy of legend, Taiki Kudou.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:57.060
And you, the Digimon who can Digivolve...

00:21:57.600 --> 00:22:02.100
Let me give you a taste of how <i>I</i> fight!

00:22:07.150 --> 00:22:09.620
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:13.140
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:13.140
Digimon Data Collection!

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:17.080
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:22:13.620 --> 00:22:17.080
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:22:14.090 --> 00:22:15.100
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:16.100
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:17.080
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:34.500
<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:39.500
<b>Machine Type</b>

00:22:22.850 --> 00:22:34.400
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:22:24.290 --> 00:22:39.500
<b>Destruction Grenade</b>

00:22:26.660 --> 00:22:29.050
Guardromon, the Digimon 
who repels intruders.

00:22:29.050 --> 00:22:33.150
His attack, Destruction Grenade, 
can follow the enemy anywhere.

00:22:33.150 --> 00:22:34.580
Very dependable.

00:22:34.580 --> 00:22:36.330
Hey, he's our natural enemy!

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:39.500
I wonder if he'd become our ally.

00:22:41.410 --> 00:22:43.380
Our friends in Xros Heart 
are about to be executed!

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:46.170
Kiriha, now is when we 
really need your help!

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:48.050
Behold! This is our pride!

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:50.560
MetalGreymon, Digivolve!

00:22:50.560 --> 00:22:52.150
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:54.340
<b>Stand Up, Kiriha!</b>

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:54.340
<b>Xros Heart's Rescue Strategy</b>

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:54.390
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
